# Coverage config (Person 3 / Stage 3).
#
# The Stage 3 crypto core — canonical, merkle, bundle, stage2_adapter and the
# local half of verify — is unit-covered by tests/test_*.py.
#
# The modules below are thin integration glue with no unit-testable logic of
# their own:
#
#   chain.py   Web3 provider wiring + contract calls
#   anchor.py  orchestrates a real anchor transaction + receipt file
#   run.py     the argparse CLI / demo driver
#
# They are exercised end-to-end by tests/test_chain.py and the Foundry suite
# against a live Anvil node, and by `make demo` / `make stage3-test`, none of
# which the mocked CI job runs.  Omitting them keeps Person 1's 95% gate a
# real measure of the logic it can actually see rather than a diluted one.
[run]
omit =
    faceproof/chain.py
    faceproof/anchor.py
    faceproof/run.py
